            et 1655&nbsp;</small></font></small><small><font face="Comic Sans MS"
          size="+1"><small><a href="paroiss.html#1655"><small><small>(réf)</small></small></a></small></font></small><small><font
          face="Comic Sans MS" size="+1"><small>
